================================ Human Message =================================

Use R and the WGCNA package to identify co-expression modules from combined RNA and protein expression data, and test which modules are associated with disease status (the Disease column in Pheno.csv). Merge the two datasets by row-binding RNA and protein features. Report the Pearson correlation of each module eigengene with Disease and its p-value.
Expected output requirements:
- file: module_trait_correlations.csv; type: csv; description: rows as WGCNA modules, columns should include Module, Correlation, Pvalue
- file: wgcna_module_trait_heatmap.png; type: png; description: heatmap; modules as rows, phenotype as columns, cells colored by Pearson correlation with correlation values overlaid
Input file names: /mnt/data/lengyang/youjia_project/autoba/BABench/src/promptbio-bench/tasks/a-15-9/result_10/biomni_20260516/data/Pheno.csv /mnt/data/lengyang/youjia_project/autoba/BABench/src/promptbio-bench/tasks/a-15-9/result_10/biomni_20260516/data/protein.csv /mnt/data/lengyang/youjia_project/autoba/BABench/src/promptbio-bench/tasks/a-15-9/result_10/biomni_20260516/data/rna.csv
